{
  "unit": "yan",
  "title": "王延之",
  "subject_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABDABAACA",
  "notes": [
    {
      "id": "n24-yan-43-0-received_sentence",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABDABAACA",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-024-wang-family:line043",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 11,
      "source_quote": "延之字希季，升之子也。",
      "reading": "希季為字，升之為生父。齊書另記出繼伯父粲之。",
      "note": "希季為字，升之為生父。齊書另記出繼伯父粲之。",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "n24-yan-43-11-received_sentence",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABDABAACA",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-024-wang-family:line043",
      "start_codepoint": 11,
      "end_codepoint": 20,
      "source_quote": "少靜默，不交人事。",
      "reading": "少年少與人交。",
      "note": "少年少與人交。",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "n24-yan-43-20-received_sentence",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABDABAACA",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-024-wang-family:line043",
      "start_codepoint": 20,
      "end_codepoint": 29,
      "source_quote": "仕宋爲司徒左長史。",
      "reading": "司徒左長史為仕宋之官。",
      "note": "司徒左長史為仕宋之官。",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "n24-yan-43-29-received_sentence",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABDABAACA",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-024-wang-family:line043",
      "start_codepoint": 29,
      "end_codepoint": 57,
      "source_quote": "清貧，居宇穿漏，褚彥回以啟宋明帝，即敕材官爲起三間齋屋。",
      "reading": "褚彥回見其住宅穿漏，宋明帝命材官為延之起三間齋屋。",
      "note": "褚彥回見其住宅穿漏，宋明帝命材官為延之起三間齋屋。",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "n24-yan-43-57-received_sentence",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABDABAACA",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-024-wang-family:line043",
      "start_codepoint": 57,
      "end_codepoint": 69,
      "source_quote": "曆吏部尚書，尚書左僕射。",
      "reading": "次敘吏部尚書、尚書左僕射。",
      "note": "次敘吏部尚書、尚書左僕射。",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "n24-yan-45-0-received_sentence",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABDABAACA",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-024-wang-family:line045",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 21,
      "source_quote": "宋德既衰，齊高帝輔政，朝野之情，人懷彼此。",
      "reading": "齊高帝輔政在宋末。",
      "note": "齊高帝輔政在宋末。",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "n24-yan-45-21-received_sentence",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABDABAACA",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-024-wang-family:line045",
      "start_codepoint": 21,
      "end_codepoint": 37,
      "source_quote": "延之與尚書令王僧虔中立無所去就。",
      "reading": "居中者為王延之、王僧虔。",
      "note": "居中者為王延之、王僧虔。",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "n24-yan-45-37-received_sentence",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABDABAACA",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-024-wang-family:line045",
      "start_codepoint": 37,
      "end_codepoint": 54,
      "source_quote": "時人語曰：「二王居平，不送不迎。」",
      "reading": "時人以「二王居平」並稱兩人，齊書作持平。",
      "note": "時人以「二王居平」並稱兩人，齊書作持平。",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "n24-yan-45-54-received_sentence",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABDABAACA",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-024-wang-family:line045",
      "start_codepoint": 54,
      "end_codepoint": 61,
      "source_quote": "高帝以此善之。",
      "reading": "高帝善二王。",
      "note": "高帝善二王。",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "n24-yan-45-61-received_sentence",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABDABAACA",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-024-wang-family:line045",
      "start_codepoint": 61,
      "end_codepoint": 77,
      "source_quote": "升明三年，出爲江州刺史，加都督。",
      "reading": "宋升明三年出刺江州，加都督。",
      "note": "宋升明三年出刺江州，加都督。",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "n24-yan-45-77-received_sentence",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABDABAACA",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-024-wang-family:line045",
      "start_codepoint": 77,
      "end_codepoint": 90,
      "source_quote": "齊建元元年，進號鎭南將軍。",
      "reading": "南史繫進號於齊建元元年，齊書繫二年。",
      "note": "南史繫進號於齊建元元年，齊書繫二年。",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "n24-yan-47-0-received_sentence",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABDABAACA",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-024-wang-family:line047",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 49,
      "source_quote": "延之與金紫光祿大夫阮韜俱宋領軍將軍劉湛外甥，並有早譽，湛甚愛之，曰：「韜後當爲第一，延之爲次也。」",
      "reading": "王延之、阮韜同為劉湛外甥。湛論二人，韜第一，延之次。",
      "note": "王延之、阮韜同為劉湛外甥。湛論二人，韜第一，延之次。",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "n24-yan-47-49-received_sentence",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABDABAACA",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-024-wang-family:line047",
      "start_codepoint": 49,
      "end_codepoint": 55,
      "source_quote": "延之甚不平。",
      "reading": "延之不平指劉湛論次。",
      "note": "延之不平指劉湛論次。",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "n24-yan-47-55-received_sentence",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABDABAACA",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-024-wang-family:line047",
      "start_codepoint": 55,
      "end_codepoint": 99,
      "source_quote": "毎致餉下都，韜與朝士同例，高帝聞之，與延之書曰：「韜雲卿未嘗有別意，當由劉家月旦故邪。」",
      "reading": "韜與其他朝士所得相同。數位本以高帝為與書人，殿本與四庫轉錄「高武」，齊書作太祖。",
      "note": "韜與其他朝士所得相同。數位本以高帝為與書人，殿本與四庫轉錄「高武」，齊書作太祖。",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "n24-yan-49-0-received_sentence",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABDABAACA",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-024-wang-family:line049",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 22,
      "source_quote": "延之居身簡素，清靜寡慾，凡所經歷，務存不擾。",
      "reading": "敘延之清靜與處政。",
      "note": "敘延之清靜與處政。",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "n24-yan-49-22-received_sentence",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABDABAACA",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-024-wang-family:line049",
      "start_codepoint": 22,
      "end_codepoint": 34,
      "source_quote": "在江州，祿俸外一無所納。",
      "reading": "江州任內只受祿俸。",
      "note": "江州任內只受祿俸。",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "n24-yan-49-34-received_sentence",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABDABAACA",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-024-wang-family:line049",
      "start_codepoint": 34,
      "end_codepoint": 59,
      "source_quote": "獨處齋內，未嘗出戸，吏人罕得見焉，雖子弟亦不妄前。",
      "reading": "自處齋內，吏人、子弟罕見。",
      "note": "自處齋內，吏人、子弟罕見。",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "n24-yan-49-59-received_sentence",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABDABAACA",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-024-wang-family:line049",
      "start_codepoint": 59,
      "end_codepoint": 78,
      "source_quote": "時時見親舊，未嘗及世事，從容談詠而已。",
      "reading": "與親舊談詠。",
      "note": "與親舊談詠。",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "n24-yan-49-78-received_sentence",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABDABAACA",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-024-wang-family:line049",
      "start_codepoint": 78,
      "end_codepoint": 98,
      "source_quote": "後爲尚書左僕射，尋領竟陵王師，卒諡簡子。",
      "reading": "再任尚書左僕射，尋領竟陵王師，簡子為諡。",
      "note": "再任尚書左僕射，尋領竟陵王師，簡子為諡。",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
